#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1344
msgctxt "helms"
msgid ""
"Maneuvers the ship with thrusters and impulse engines, employs faster-than-"
"light propulsion methods, docks with other ships and space stations, and "
"retrieves objects"
msgstr "Manoeuvres the ship with thrusters and impulse engines, employs faster-than-light propulsion methods, docks with other ships and space stations, and retrieves objects"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1347
msgctxt "weapons"
msgid ""
"Manages a ship's offensive and defensive systems; loads, unloads, aims, and "
"fires weapon tubes; targets beam weapons; and sets beam and shield "
"frequencies"
msgstr "Manages a ship's offensive and defensive systems; loads, unloads, aims, and fires weapon tubes; targets beam weapons; and sets beam and shield frequencies"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1350
msgctxt "engineering"
msgid ""
"Manages a ship's power, heat, coolant, and damage; directs repair crews; "
"tracks system effectiveness; and controls the ship's self-destruct system"
msgstr "Manages a ship's power, heat, coolant, and damage; directs repair crews; tracks system effectiveness; and controls the ship's self-destruct system"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1353
msgctxt "science"
msgid ""
"Examines and reports on the ship's surroundings, and researches entities "
"using the ship's sensors and database"
msgstr "Examines and reports on the ship's surroundings, and researches entities using the ship's sensors and database"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1356
msgctxt "relay"
msgid ""
"Manages the flow of information between the ship and other ships and space "
"stations across the region, hails and communicates with other entities, "
"launches scan probes, sets navigational waypoints, and hacks hostile entities"
msgstr "Manages the flow of information between the ship and other ships and space stations across the region, hails and communicates with other entities, launches scan probes, sets navigational waypoints, and hacks hostile entities"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1359
msgctxt "tactical"
msgid ""
"Combines the responsibilities of Helms (maneuvering, propulsion, docking) "
"with Weapons (loading, targeting, and firing weapons). However, also lacks "
"Weapons' control over shields."
msgstr "Combines the responsibilities of Helms (manoeuvring, propulsion, docking) with Weapons (loading, targeting, and firing weapons). However, also lacks Weapons' control over shields."

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1362
msgctxt "engineering+"
msgid ""
"Manages a ship's power, heat, coolant, and damage; manages shield activation "
"and calibration; directs repair crews; tracks system effectiveness; and "
"controls the ship's self-destruct system"
msgstr "Manages a ship's power, heat, coolant, and damage; manages shield activation and calibration; directs repair crews; tracks system effectiveness; and controls the ship's self-destruct system"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1365
msgctxt "operations"
msgid ""
"Combines the responsibilities of Science (scanning, research) with Relay "
"(communication, navigation). However, also lacks Relay's access to the "
"sector map or hacking features."
msgstr "Combines the responsibilities of Science (scanning, research) with Relay (communication, navigation). However, also lacks Relay's access to the sector map or hacking features."

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1368
msgctxt "single_pilot"
msgid ""
"Combines essential functions from Helms, Weapons, and Relay, at the expense "
"of several other features"
msgstr "Combines essential functions from Helms, Weapons, and Relay, at the expense of several other features"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1371
msgctxt "beam_weapons"
msgid ""
"Manages and targets the ship's beam weapons, as a specialized subset of "
"Weapons functions"
msgstr "Manages and targets the ship's beam weapons, as a specialised subset of Weapons functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1374
msgctxt "missile_weapons"
msgid ""
"Manages and targets the ship's weapons tubes, including missiles and mines, "
"as a specialized subset of Weapons functions"
msgstr "Manages and targets the ship's weapons tubes, including missiles and mines, as a specialised subset of Weapons functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1377
msgctxt "damage_control"
msgid ""
"Manages the ship's repair crews from a systems overview display, as a "
"specialized subset of Engineering functions"
msgstr "Manages the ship's repair crews from a systems overview display, as a specialised subset of Engineering functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1380
msgctxt "power_management"
msgid ""
"Routes power and coolant to the ship's systems, as a specialized subset of "
"Engineering functions"
msgstr "Routes power and coolant to the ship's systems, as a specialised subset of Engineering functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1383
msgctxt "database"
msgid ""
"Researches information in the ship's database, as a specialized subset of "
"Science functions"
msgstr "Researches information in the ship's database, as a specialised subset of Science functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1386
msgctxt "docking_bay"
msgid ""
"Controls the ship's internal docking bay, if any, including launching, "
"reparing, and restocking berthed ships"
msgstr "Controls the ship's internal docking bay, if any, including launching, reparing, and restocking berthed ships"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1389
msgctxt "strategic_map"
msgid ""
"Views a sector map, launches scan probes, sets navigational waypoints, and "
"hacks hostile entities. A specialized subset of Relay functions, with "
"communications delegated to the Comms screen."
msgstr "Views a sector map, launches scan probes, sets navigational waypoints, and hacks hostile entities. A specialised subset of Relay functions, with communications delegated to the Comms screen."

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1392
msgctxt "comms"
msgid ""
"Displays active communications with other entities, as a specialized subset "
"of Relay functions"
msgstr "Displays active communications with other entities, as a specialised subset of Relay functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1395
msgctxt "ships_log"
msgid "Displays the ship's log, as a specialized subset of Relay functions"
msgstr "Displays the ship's log, as a specialised subset of Relay functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1398
msgctxt "radar"
msgid ""
"Displays a non-interactive ship's radar at short, long, and sector ranges, "
"as well as of any linked probe, as a specialized subset of Science and Relay "
"functions"
msgstr "Displays a non-interactive ship's radar at short, long, and sector ranges, as well as of any linked probe, as a specialised subset of Science and Relay functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1401
msgctxt "probe_camera"
msgid ""
"Displays the view from the linked probe's camera, with rotation controls"
msgstr "Displays the view from the linked probe's camera, with rotation controls"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1404
msgctxt "target_analysis"
msgid ""
"Displays known information about a target linked to this screen by the "
"Science officer, as a specialized subset of Science functions"
msgstr "Displays known information about a target linked to this screen by the Science officer, as a specialised subset of Science functions"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1407
msgctxt "briefing"
msgid ""
"Displays the scenario's briefing presentation, if implemented by the scenario"
msgstr "Displays the scenario's briefing presentation, if implemented by the scenario"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1410
msgctxt "drone_operations"
msgid ""
"Provides control over linked probes, if the ship has a drone controller and "
"linked drones are within control range"
msgstr "Provides control over linked probes, if the ship has a drone controller and linked drones are within control range"

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1413
msgid ""
"Select at least one crew screen to play.\n"
"You can select multiple crew screens and switch between them during the "
"game. You can also select the main screen alongside any other screen, which "
"splits the screen to show the viewscreen if your display's width is "
"sufficient."
msgstr "Select at least one crew screen to play.\nYou can select multiple crew screens and switch between them during the game. You can also select the main screen alongside any other screen, which splits the screen to show the viewscreen if your display's width is sufficient."

