msgctxt "tweak-faction"
msgid ""
"The faction to which this entity belongs. An entity's faction determines "
"which entities are friendly, neutral, or hostile to this entity in combat "
"and interactions. This can also be set using the faction selector at the top "
"left of the GM screen."
msgstr "The faction to which this entity belongs. An entity's faction determines which entities are friendly, neutral, or hostile to this entity in combat and interactions. This can also be set using the faction selector at the top left of the GM screen."

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4334
msgctxt "tweak-spin"
msgid ""
"Makes the entity rotate continuously at the given rate in degrees per "
"second. Useful for terrain and decorative objects, such as asteroids and "
"debris. Combine with Planet renderer to roughly simulate planetary rotation, "
"particularly with other entities using Orbit.\n"
"\n"
"Ships should instead use the Manuvering thrusters component to control their "
"own rotation."
msgstr "Makes the entity rotate continuously at the given rate in degrees per second. Useful for terrain and decorative objects, such as asteroids and debris. Combine with Planet renderer to roughly simulate planetary rotation, particularly with other entities using Orbit.\n\nShips should instead use the Manuvering thrusters component to control their own rotation."

